# Mastermind UI design system

For any customer-facing UI/design/refactor/review task, use the installed `mastermind-design-system` skill before editing. Determine the canonical A–I archetype, compose only sanctioned components, bind to `templates/theme.css` tokens/classes, preserve dark/light + EN/ZH + responsive + degraded-state semantics, and treat missing primitives as `DESIGN-SYSTEM-GAP` instead of inventing page-local design vocabulary.
